Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:55:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1030/1179] Debuzz as a Post step, and the tree of derived
 files under every step

- Debuzz (step 3, after Artifacts): lab/debuzz.py on the take or a file of the tree, 60-100 %
  (80 % default, Viktor's ear). A branch of the tree, its manifest carrying the frame ripple
  in and out against the controls (1900/1940 samples), or "no frame ripple found" on a track
  the VAE did not make.
- Remaster takes a debuzzed file as its source too; Upscale already took any file.
- "Made from this take" sits under the steps, not inside Stems: remaster, upscale and debuzz
  results are seen from every step.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
